    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0727" n="613" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg613"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.53/122: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-13">August 13,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5313. Your message 4856, August 12, 1 a.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d312-f1"/> was
                    communicated by me to Mr. Eden last night. This afternoon the Foreign Office
                    informed me that the British reply would be made through the British Embassy in
                    Washington and the Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
